cert_info.description:
CELTA from Cambridge is a qualification for teaching English as a foreign language. It is the most widely recognised English teaching qualification in the world.
Learners and teachers, and the teaching / learning context;
Language analysis and awareness;
Language skills: speaking, listening, reading and writing;
Lesson planning, resources and materials;
Developing teaching skills and professionalism.

